{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-00. It distinguishes missing from null via a presence guard before reading offset, accepts exact integers -4..5 inclusive (rejecting bool/float/other), and always returns {accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null}. The helper is invoked at module scope and its returned object is assigned to result. No imports, I/O, host calls, Tool dispatch, tests, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation occurred; target typed inputs needs selected-runner support.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-00", "description": "Raw offset may omit or contain any JSON value. Accept exact integers -4..5 inclusive (not bool/float). Always result={accepted:boolean, offset:original if accepted else null}; invalid/missing return false/null without exceptions or coercion. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft only; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 required.", "content": "def inspect_offset(value):
    if 'offset' not in inputs:
        return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
    if type(value) is int and -4 <= value <= 5:
        return {'accepted': True, 'offset': value}
    return {'accepted': False, 'offset': None}
result = inspect_offset(inputs.get('offset'))"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
